---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Party Pics" current="Party Pics">
  <p class="kicker">Party Pics</p>
  <h1>Friday and Saturday, posted Monday</h1>
  <p class="lede">A photographer at two bars per city every weekend. Galleries land here and on Instagram; tag yourself, find your friends, regret nothing.</p>
  <section class="card">
    <h3>Nothing here yet</h3>
    <p>Galleries start the first weekend we're live. Until then, this is the plan: consent at the door, a takedown address on every gallery, no photos of anyone visibly wrecked.</p>
    <p class="verify">To publish a gallery, drop images in <code>public/pics/&lt;yyyy-mm-dd&gt;-&lt;venue-slug&gt;/</code> and add an entry to <code>src/data/galleries.json</code> (see README).</p>
  </section>
  <p><strong>Takedown requests:</strong> email pics@380tonight.com with the gallery date and venue. We remove the photo, no questions.</p>
</Base>
